#
# These evidence files are pinned by SHA-256 over their raw bytes
# (tests/test_p6_sdk_gap_gate.py). Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites
# LF as CRLF and the same content hashes differently: the pinned LF digest
# 24ae84d6... becomes 3f1c331e..., which is a false failure that says nothing
# about the evidence. -text keeps the recorded bytes as recorded on every host.
#
# Same convention as tests/.gitattributes and docs/evidence/.gitattributes.
/SDK_GAP_PARITY_46.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
/SDK_GAP_TRAJECTORY_46.json -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
